---
description: Thadam website, docs, and brand rules
globs: website/**,thadam-assets/**
alwaysApply: false
---

Follow the "Website and documentation" section of `AGENTS.md`.

- Brand: use the SVGs in `thadam-assets/brand/svg/` unmodified; take colours only from `thadam-assets/brand/tokens/thadam.css`.
- Brand files never go under `website/docs/src/`. The only brand copies inside `website/` are the two favicons in `website/docs/theme/`, which `build.sh` checks with `cmp`.
- Content: every integration or feature is Available, In progress, or Planned (`check.py` enforces homepage pills/status cells, docs `Status:` lines, no `PR[0-9]+` tokens in visible text, and `#fragment` link targets), backed by `docs/design/readiness.md`, `CHANGELOG.md`, and the code. Claim wording on the homepage and every docs page must follow `ADR-0011`; no invented commands, benchmarks, or "zero data loss" claims.
- Routing: docs-page canonicals are extensionless; origin is `https://thadam.dineshkarthik.me`; no deploy steps, wrangler config, or secrets.
- After a change, run `website/scripts/build.sh` and `python3 website/scripts/check.py`.
